#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/geodata/settings.js:31
msgid ""
"Loyalsoldier is the recommended default: it contains all required codes (including TELEGRAM) and keeps xray at about "
"250 MB of RAM. The runetfreedom geosite.dat is about 89 MB and makes xray use about 1.3 GB of RAM. v2fly geoip.dat "
"lacks the TELEGRAM code, which breaks xray configurations using geoip:telegram (EOF error). Custom URLs must use "
"HTTPS."
msgstr ""

